.env
.env.*
# Templates carry no values, only the names and where to get them. `.env.*`
# above swallows them too, which quietly kept .env.production.example out of
# the repository — a deployment checklist that exists on one laptop is not a
# checklist. Anything ending .example is safe to track by construction.
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
.DS_Store
